msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Lista de comprobación de migración"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:159
msgid "For a clean port to v3.6.1 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para una migración limpia a v3.6.1 el trabajo típico es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:161
msgid ""
"Remove :func:`sensor.set_framerate` calls (:ref:`the set_framerate removal "
"<v3_6_1_setframerate>`)."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar las llamadas a :func:`sensor.set_framerate` (:ref:`la eliminación "
"de set_framerate <v3_6_1_setframerate>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:163
msgid ""
"Move TensorFlow workloads off the OpenMV Cam M7 (:ref:`the M7 TensorFlow "
"change <v3_6_1_tfm7>`)."
msgstr ""
"Mover las cargas de trabajo de TensorFlow fuera de la OpenMV Cam M7 "
"(:ref:`el cambio de TensorFlow en la M7 <v3_6_1_tfm7>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:165
msgid ""
"Stop relying on the return value of ``set_pixformat()`` / "
"``set_framesize()`` and catch ``ValueError`` for unsupported pixel formats "
"(:ref:`the return-value change <v3_6_1_setreturn>`)."
msgstr ""
"Dejar de depender del valor de retorno de ``set_pixformat()`` / "
"``set_framesize()`` y capturar ``ValueError`` para formatos de píxel no "
"soportados (:ref:`el cambio del valor de retorno <v3_6_1_setreturn>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:168
msgid ""
"Ensure even image dimensions before ``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` / "
"``logpolar()`` (:ref:`the even-dimension requirement <v3_6_1_evendims>`)."
msgstr ""
"Asegurar dimensiones de imagen pares antes de ``lens_corr()`` / "
"``linpolar()`` / ``logpolar()`` (:ref:`el requisito de dimensiones pares "
"<v3_6_1_evendims>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:171
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Todos los demás scripts se ejecutan sin cambios."
